cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this versioned 28-population dataset and analysis code; this is not a manuscript preprint."
type: dataset
title: "Public reconstructibility of suicide-related outcomes in 28 liraglutide, semaglutide and tirzepatide trial populations: data and code"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
authors:
