license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: "Bounded retrospective documentary audit of 28 randomized populations from 27 trial registry identifiers. Four population/window references and ascertainment modalities are analyzed separately. Direct and derived proofs remain distinct and unknowns remain in denominators. The current data and code are separate from the historical 182/159-unit corpus and do not estimate clinical suicide risk or treatment effects."
